      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11180184::web::023::powder_processing_and_manufacturing"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "An approximately 30-second dwell period per layer is suitable for promoting the desired SRO.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adaptive laser energy modulation can be calibrated to promote favorable nonequilibrium SRO.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A build-plate temperature of approximately 150 °C is applicable to the proposed AlCrFeNiSi process.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11180184::web::023::powder_processing_and_manufacturing",
        "PMC11807212::web::018::materials_fabrication"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The process should be conducted under an inert atmosphere.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11180184::web::023::powder_processing_and_manufacturing",
        "PMC11807212::web::018::materials_fabrication"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Single-track experiments can be used to identify an acceptable layer-thickness, hatch-spacing, power, and scan-speed window.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12250662::web::014::3_1_1_single_scan_tracks_sst"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lowering per-layer energy input reduces thermal gradients and peak temperatures.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9736672::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC9698306::web::014::3_1_pbf_lb_parameter_study"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A layer dwell period provides time for local annealing.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Local low-temperature annealing can relax residual stresses.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12463031::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beneficial nonequilibrium SRO inhibits the nucleation of deleterious phases and microstructural defects.",
      "field": "mechanism",
