      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12463031::web::011::development_of_chemical_sros"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified process will significantly reduce residual stresses relative to conventional high-thermal-load LPBF.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11807212::web::018::materials_fabrication",
        "PMC12463031::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9736672::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified process will enhance both strength and ductility relative to conventional high-thermal-load LPBF.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12463031::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified process will simplify the manufacturing workflow by minimizing extensive post-processing.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
